    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE FIRESIGN THEATRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Firesign Theatre is a comedy group that Peter Bergman and Peter Paul Bergman were part of, formed from their show 'Radio Free Oz' on KPFK."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Firesign Theatre is a comedy group that Peter Bergman was a part of, formed from his show 'Radio Free Oz' on KPFK."</data>
